synonym: "mitotic G2/M transition delay during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mitotic G2/M transition DNA damage checkpoint activated" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "reduced rate of mitotic G2 phase progression" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "transient cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "transient cell cycle arrest in mitotic G2 phase" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
