created_by: midori
creation_date: 2011-04-19T02:59:38Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0000240
name: abnormal filament morphology
def: "A cell population phenotype in which the size, shape, or structure of invasively growing filaments is abnormal." [PomBase:mah]
