[Term]
id: FYPO:0000675
name: abnormal protein targeting during vegetative growth
def: "A transport phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which protein targeting is abnormal." [PomBase:mah]
comment: Encompasses both targeting of proteins to a particular location where they are not normally found and decreased or no targeting of proteins normally found in the location. We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
