synonym: "abnormal protein localization to actin patch" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal protein localization to F-actin patch" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000443 ! abnormal protein localization during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2012-01-11T12:45:30Z

