synonym: "ectopic protein localization to nucleus during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "protein mislocalised to nucleus during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "protein mislocalized to nucleus during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
