created_by: midori
creation_date: 2012-03-01T03:29:58Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0000808
name: abnormal lipid droplet organization
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which lipid droplet organization is abnormal. Lipid droplet organization results in the assembly, arrangement of constituent parts, or disassembly of a lipid droplet." [GO:0034389, PomBase:mah]
comment: Consider annotating to 'abnormal lipid droplet morphology' (FYPO:0000356), but note that an abnormal lipid droplet organization process may, but does not necessarily, result in abnormal lipid droplet morphology.
