[Term]
id: FYPO:0000838
name: normal protein localization to nucleus during vegetative growth
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the localization of a protein to the nucleus is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PomBase:mah]
