creation_date: 2012-03-30T04:40:50Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0000901
name: abnormal microtubule dynamics during vegetative growth
def: "A  microtubule cytoskeleton organization phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which microtubule growth (polymerization), catastrophe (the transition from growth to shrinkage), shrinkage (depolymerization), or rescue (the transition from shrinkage to growth) is abnormal." [GO:0031109, PomBase:val]
