[Term]
id: FYPO:0001501
name: sensitive to brefeldin A
def: "A phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells show increased sensitivity to brefeldin A. Cells stop growing (and may die) at a concentration of brefeldin A that allows wild type cells to grow." [PomBase:mah]
