synonym: "inviable swollen elongated mononucleate monoseptate vegetative cell with mislocalized septum near new end" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "inviable swollen elongated mononucleate vegetative cell with mislocalised septum near new end" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
