created_by: midori
creation_date: 2013-06-05T16:35:26Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0002223
name: abnormal cell cycle arrest in meiosis II
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which progression through the meiotic cell cycle is arrested in meiosis II. Meiosis II is the second phase of meiosis, in which cells divide and separate the two chromatids in each chromosome." [GO:0007135, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal cell cycle arrest in second meiotic nuclear division" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0002224 ! abnormally arrested meiotic cell cycle
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2013-06-05T16:40:26Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0002224
name: abnormally arrested meiotic cell cycle
