def: "A molecular function phenotype in which an interaction between a protein and RNA is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). One of the relevant gene products may be encoded by the mutated gene, or both the RNA and protein may be encoded by genes other than the mutated one." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal RNA binding" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal RNA-protein interaction" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000706 ! normal molecular function
