[Term]
id: FYPO:0002488
name: cell lysis
def: "An inviable phenotype in which a cell lyses, i.e. the plasma membrane ruptures and cytoplasm is lost. Note that in fission yeast cell lysis, the integrity of the cell wall is also compromised." [PomBase:mah]
