synonym: "decreased protein localization to medial ring, with protein distributed in cell cortex near non-growing end, during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "reduced protein localization to medial cortex during vegetative growth, with protein distributed in cell cortex near non-growing end" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
