synonym: "decreased RNA level during cellular response to glucose stimulus during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased transcript level during cellular response to glucose stimulus" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "reduced RNA level during cellular response to glucose stimulus" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001117 ! decreased RNA level during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2013-09-05T15:50:26Z

[Term]
