[Term]
id: FYPO:0002858
name: increased (1->3)-beta-D-glucan level at cell tip
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount of (1->3)-beta-D-glucan measured at the cell tip is greater than normal." [PMID:17581129, PMID:21652630, PomBase:mah]
