synonym: "abnormal protein localization to nuclear exosome focus during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001129 ! abnormal protein localization to nucleus during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2013-12-10T11:59:35Z

