synonym: "abolished contractile ring assembly, clumped medial cortical nodes" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished cytokinetic contractile ring assembly, clumped medial cortical nodes" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abolished cytokinetic ring assembly, clumped medial cortical nodes" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
