synonym: "abolished mitotic contractile ring assembly, clumped medial cortical nodes" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "actomyosin contractile ring assembly abolished, clumped medial cortical nodes" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "cytokinesis defects, contractile ring actin, absent, with clumped medial cortical nodes" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001009 ! abolished actomyosin contractile ring assembly
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2013-12-17T14:12:17Z

