def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which transcription occurs to a normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) extent during a cellular response to ultraviolet light. All genes, or a specific subset of genes, may be measured." [PomBase:mah]
