[Term]
id: FYPO:0003116
name: sensitive to plumbagin
def: "A phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells show increased sensitivity to plumbagin. Cells stop growing (and may die) at a concentration of plumbagin that allows wild type cells to grow." [PomBase:mah]
