def: "A molecular function phenotype in which the binding of one protein to another is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) during a cellular response to hydrogen peroxide. The relevant proteins may include the one encoded by the mutated gene, or may both be encoded by different genes." [PomBase:mah]
