def: "OBSOLETE. A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount of small RNA measured in a cell is lower than normal. All types of small RNA, a particular RNA type, or a specific small RNA may be affected." [PMID:24095277, PomBase:mah]
