synonym: "increased spatial extent of centromere-specific nucleosome assembly" EXACT [GO:0034080]
synonym: "increased spatial extent of centromeric DNA replication-independent nucleosome assembly" EXACT [GO:0034080]
synonym: "increased spatial extent of DNA replication-independent nucleosome assembly at centromere" EXACT [GO:0034080]
