[Term]
id: FYPO:0003423
name: decreased mitochondrial RNA level
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount of mitochondrial RNA measured in a cell is lower than normal. Total RNA or a specific RNA may be affected." [PomBase:mah]
