comment: An increased level of a protein in the plasma membrane may result from increased protein transport to the membrane ('increased protein localization to plasma membrane FYPO:0002127), decreased endocytosis from the membrane ('abolished endocytosis' FYPO:0000421 or 'decreased endocytosis' FYPO:0000422), or both. We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "increased plasma membrane protein level during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
