[Term]
id: FYPO:0003825
name: inviable binucleate aseptate cell with cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition before cell separation
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which a cell is inviable and has two nuclei but no septum, and the mitotic cell cycle is arrested with nuclei at the mitotic G2/M phase transition." [PomBase:mah]
comment: This phenotype may indicate that the cytokinesis after mitosis checkpoint is activated. Use this term when a cell goes through a cell cycle without cytokinesis taking place. In the subsequent cell cycle, the two nuclei can go through G1 and S phases but cannot undergo mitosis, so the nuclei remain in G2 phase. The cell does not contain a post-anaphase microtubule array.
synonym: "inviable binucleate aseptate cell with cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition before cell separation during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "inviable binucleate aseptate cell with cell cycle arrest in mitotic G2 phase before cell separation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "inviable binucleate aseptate cell with mitotic cell cycle arrest at G2/M before cytokinesis" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "inviable binucleate aseptate cell with mitotic cell cycle arrest at G2/M phase transition before cell separation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "inviable binucleate aseptate cell with mitotic G2/M phase transition arrest before cell separation" EXACT []
synonym: "inviable binucleate cell with mitotic cell cycle arrest at G2/M before division septum assembly" EXACT [GO:0000917]
synonym: "inviable cell with mitotic G2/M arrest after failed cytokinesis" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "inviable cell with nuclear division arrest at G2/M without septation (normal cell length)" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "lethal; binucleate aseptate cell with mitotic cell cycle arrest at G2/M before cell separation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mitotic cell cycle arrest at G2/M before cell separation with inviable binucleate aseptate cell" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0000400 ! abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition
is_a: FYPO:0005689 ! inviable binucleate aseptate cell with mitotic cell cycle arrest before cell separation
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2014-10-14T15:42:02Z

