creation_date: 2014-10-16T16:23:04Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0003872
name: increased glutathione level during G0
def: "A cell phenotype in which the amount of glutathione measured in a cell is higher than normal when the cell is in G0 phase." [PMID:20133687, PomBase:mah]
