created_by: midori
creation_date: 2014-11-19T15:05:50Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0004022
name: abnormal cell cycle arrest in mitotic metaphase with long polar microtubules
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which progression through the mitotic cell cycle is arrested in metaphase under conditions where arrest does not normally occur, with polar microtubules that are longer than normal." [PMID:16079915, PomBase:mah]
