def: "A molecular function phenotype in which occurrence of DNA binding at microsatellite repeat regions by a gene product is decreased, when a gene or the bound DNA sequence is mutated. The affected gene product may be encoded by the mutated gene, or by a different gene." [PomBase:mah]
