is_a: FYPO:0002399 ! abnormal microtubule cytoskeleton
relationship: output_of FYPO:0001350 ! abnormal microtubule cytoskeleton organization during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2015-01-19T12:11:31Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0004316
