[Term]
id: FYPO:0004371
name: decreased duration of S-phase DNA damage checkpoint
def: "A cell cycle checkpoint phenotype in which the duration of cell cycle arrest or delay due to regulation by the S-phase DNA damage checkpoint is lower than in wild type." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased duration of intra-S DNA damage checkpoint" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
