creation_date: 2015-02-17T15:19:23Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0004403
name: resistance to JM216
def: "An increased chemical resistance phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells grow in the presence of a higher concentration of JM216 (also called satraplatin) than normal." [PomBase:mah]
