synonym: "decreased RNA level during phosphate starvation" EXACT [PomBase:al]
synonym: "decreased transcript level during cellular response to phosphate starvation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "reduced RNA level during cellular response to phosphate starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
