name: decreased protein degradation during sporulation
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which the occurrence of protein degradation is decreased during sporulation." [PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "decreased protein catabolic process during sporulation" EXACT [GO:0030163, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased protein catabolism during sporulation" EXACT [GO:0030163, PomBase:mah]
