synonym: "decreased transcript level during exit from mitosis" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "reduced RNA level during exit from mitosis" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001117 ! decreased RNA level during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2015-10-14T11:58:05Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0004936
name: abolished DNA binding at PCB
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which DNA binding at an RNA polymerase II proximal promoter that contains a pombe cell cycle box (PCB) by a gene product does not occur, when a gene or the bound DNA sequence is mutated. The affected gene product may be encoded by the mutated gene, or by a different gene." [GO:0000978, PMID:12411492, PomBase:mah, SO:0001871]
