synonym: "inviable following spore germination, without cell division, swollen binucleate multiseptate cell with central constriction" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "inviable germinated spore, without cell division, swollen binucleate multiseptate cell with central constriction" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "lethal after spore germination, without cell division, swollen binucleate multiseptate cell with central constriction" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
