[Term]
id: FYPO:0005271
name: abnormal microtubule plus-end directed mitotic chromosome migration
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which microtubule plus-end directed mitotic chromosome migration is abnormal. In microtubule plus-end directed mitotic chromosome migration, chromosomes that are laterally attached to one or more mitotic spindle microtubules migrate towards the spindle equator via plus-end-directed movement along the microtubules." [GO:0099606, PomBase:mah]
