created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-03-15T15:47:20Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005334
name: increased number of Holliday junctions
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the Holliday junctions is greater than normal. A Holliday junction is a structure where two DNA double strands are held together by reciprocal exchange of two of the four strands, one strand each from the two original helices." [GO:0000400, PMID:15367656, PomBase:mah]
comment: This phenotype can be detected by measuring the amount of DNA that migrates as X-shaped in two-dimensional agarose gels.
synonym: "increased amount of X-shaped DNA" RELATED [PomBase:pr]
synonym: "increased number of four-way junctions" EXACT [PMID:22927644]
synonym: "increased number of Holliday junctions during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased number of Holliday junctions during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0004639 ! abnormal cellular physical quality phenotype during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-03-15T15:49:17Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005335
name: abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition during glucose starvation
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which progression through mitotic cell cycle arrest at the mitotic G2/M phase transition occurs abnormally when the cell is subject to glucose starvation." [PMID:26804466, PomBase:al, PomBase:mah]
comment: Cells normally arrest the mitotic cell cycle at the mitotic G2/M phase transition when subject to glucose starvation. Use this term if the G2 arrest does not occur exactly as in wild type cells. Note that FYPO uses "glucose starvation" to refer specifically to conditions in which glucose is scarce enough to trigger mating, meiosis, and sporulation. For phenotypes observed in the presence of enough glucose to prevent cells from mating, use a term that specifies "during vegetative growth" plus a condition to indicate low glucose.
synonym: "abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition during glucose deprivation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition during glucose limitation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal cell cycle arrest in mitotic G2 phase during glucose depletion" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abnormal mitotic cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition during glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished mitotic G2/M phase transition during glucose starvation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000502 ! abnormally arrested mitotic cell cycle progression
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-04-04T12:44:23Z

