[Term]
id: FYPO:0005357
name: decreased site-specific DNA replication termination at RTS1 barrier
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which site-specific DNA replication termination at RTS1 barrier in the mating type region occurs to a lower extent than normal." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased site-specific DNA replication termination at RTS1 barrier during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
