[Term]
id: FYPO:0005359
name: normal termination of RNA polymerase II transcription at RTS1 barrier
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the termination of transcription by RNA polymerase II at the RTS1 replication fork barrier is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PMID:12840005, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal RNA polymerase II release at RTS1 barrier" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal RNA polymerase II transcription termination at RTS1 barrier" EXACT [GO:0006369]
synonym: "normal termination of RNA polymerase II transcription at RTS1 barrier during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
