def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the phosphorylation of one or more specific proteins, or of specific protein sites, does not occur during mitosis." [PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
