[Term]
id: FYPO:0005368
name: decreased level of iron ion starvation-induced proteins
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount of protein encoded by genes normally induced during iron ion starvation measured in a cell is lower than normal." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased level of iron ion depletion-induced proteins" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
