created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-05-13T13:40:01Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005412
name: delayed onset of meiosis II
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which the second meiotic nuclear division begins later than normal." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed meiosis II" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed onset of second meiotic nuclear division" EXACT [GO:0007127]
