synonym: "inviable elongated vegetative cell with fragmented nuclear DNA and mitotic cell cycle arrest in interphase during cellular response to UV" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "inviable elongated vegetative cell with fragmented nucleus and cell cycle arrest in interphase during cellular response to UV during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
