[Term]
id: FYPO:0005425
name: curved elongated vegetative cell with long curved interphase microtubules
def: "A cell morphology phenotype in which a vegetatively growing cell is elongated, is curved along the long axis, and contains cytoplasmic microtubules that are longer than normal and curved. In a curved cell, the long axis follows a smooth bend rather than a straight line." [PomBase:mah]
comment: In these cells, cytoplasmic microtubules often become long enough to loop around the ends of the cell.
synonym: "curved elongated cell with elongated curved interphase microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "curved elongated cell with long curved interphase microtubules during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "curved elongated vegetative cell with long curved cytoplasmic microtubules during mitotic interphase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "curved elongated vegetative cell with long curved interphase cytoplasmic microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "curved elongated vegetative cell with long curved interphase microtubules during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001418 ! abnormal microtubule cytoskeleton morphology during vegetative growth
is_a: FYPO:0005103 ! curved elongated vegetative cell
relationship: has_part FYPO:0004863 ! long curved microtubules
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-06-06T13:05:53Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005426
name: elongated C-shaped vegetative cell with long curved interphase microtubules
def: "A cell morphology phenotype in which a vegetatively growing cell is elongated, is curved along the long axis to form a \"C\" shape, and contains cytoplasmic microtubules that are longer than normal and curved. In a curved cell, the long axis follows a smooth bend rather than a straight line. In a C-shaped cell, the curve is centered at the midpoint of the long axis of the cell. Microtubules curve around the ends of the cell and may become long enough to form loops." [PMID:11739790, PomBase:mah, PomBase:vw]
synonym: "curved elongated C-shaped vegetative cell with long curved interphase microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated C-shaped cell with elongated curved interphase microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated C-shaped cell with long curved interphase microtubules during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated C-shaped vegetative cell with long curved cytoplasmic microtubules during mitotic interphase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated C-shaped vegetative cell with long curved interphase cytoplasmic microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated C-shaped vegetative cell with long curved interphase microtubules during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0005425 ! curved elongated vegetative cell with long curved interphase microtubules
is_a: FYPO:0005789 ! C-shaped vegetative cell
relationship: has_part FYPO:0005789 ! C-shaped vegetative cell
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-06-06T13:07:32Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005427
name: elongated J-shaped vegetative cell with curved interphase microtubules
def: "A cell morphology phenotype in which a vegetatively growing cell is elongated, is curved along the long axis to form a \"J\" shape, and contains cytoplasmic microtubules that curve to follow the long axis of the cell. In a curved cell, the long axis follows a smooth bend rather than a straight line. In a J-shaped cell, the curve is centered away from the midpoint of the long axis of the cell." [PMID:11739790, PomBase:mah, PomBase:vw]
comment: Microtubules in these cells are longer than in wild-type cells, but they are not regarded as elongated because they are normal in proportion to cell length.
synonym: "curved elongated J-shaped vegetative cell with curved cytoplasmic microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated J-shaped cell with curved cytoplasmic microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated J-shaped cell with curved interphase microtubules during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated J-shaped vegetative cell with curved cytoplasmic microtubules during mitotic interphase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated J-shaped vegetative cell with curved interphase cytoplasmic microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated J-shaped vegetative cell with curved interphase microtubules during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0003327 ! curved interphase microtubules
is_a: FYPO:0005425 ! curved elongated vegetative cell with long curved interphase microtubules
is_a: FYPO:0005790 ! J-shaped vegetative cell
relationship: has_part FYPO:0003327 ! curved interphase microtubules
