comment: This term can mean that the mutated gene product itself binds an iron-sulfur cluster less than wild type, or that a mutation in one gene decreases iron-sulfur cluster binding by a second gene product. When using this term, it is therefore recommended to note the specific protein(s) affected.
synonym: "decreased iron-sulphur cluster binding" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "reduced iron-sulfur cluster binding" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
