synonym: "normal mitotic G2 DNA damage checkpoint during cellular response to UV during mitotic S phase during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal mitotic G2 DNA damage checkpoint response after UV irradiation during S phase" EXACT [PMID:26652183]
is_a: FYPO:0005299 ! normal mitotic G2 DNA damage checkpoint during cellular response to UV
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-08-22T11:51:14Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005627
name: increased duration of mitotic DNA damage checkpoint during cellular response to UV during mitotic S phase
def: "A cell cycle checkpoint phenotype in which the duration of cell cycle arrest or delay due to regulation by any mitotic DNA damage checkpoint is greater than in wild type during a cellular response to ultraviolet (UV) light, when cells are exposed to UV during S phase of the mitotic cell cycle." [PMID:26652183, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed DNA damage checkpoint deactivation during cellular response to UV during mitotic S phase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased duration of mitotic DNA damage checkpoint after UV irradiation during S phase" EXACT [PMID:26652183]
