[Term]
id: FYPO:0005650
name: normal onset of premeiotic DNA replication
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which premeiotic DNA replication begins at the normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) time relative to other cell cycle events." [PomBase:mah]
