[Term]
id: FYPO:0005726
name: abolished deactivation of mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint
def: "A cell cycle checkpoint phenotype in which deactivation of the mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint does not occur. The mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint normally delays the metaphase/anaphase transition of a mitotic nuclear division until the spindle is correctly assembled and chromosomes are attached to the spindle." [PMID:19592249, PMID:21664573, PomBase:mah, PomBase:vw]
comment: The difference between this term and constitutive activation of mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint (FYPO:000) is that this term describes cells in which the checkpoint is not active at first, but once activated the checkpoint is not deactivated, whereas FYPO:0007 describes cells in which the checkpoint is always active, i.e. the checkpoint is never observed to be "off". Checkpoint activation in a mutant usually implies that the mutation is causing problems that the checkpoint detects.
synonym: "abolished deactivation of mitotic cell cycle spindle assembly checkpoint" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint deactivation" EXACT [GO:1902426]
synonym: "abolished mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint silencing" EXACT [GO:1902426]
synonym: "deactivation of mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint abolished" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000168 ! abnormal mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-11-02T13:30:06Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005727
name: decreased rate of deactivation of mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint
def: "A cell cycle checkpoint phenotype in which deactivation of the mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint occurs more slowly than normal. The mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint normally delays the metaphase/anaphase transition of a mitotic nuclear division until the spindle is correctly assembled and chromosomes are attached to the spindle." [PMID:19592249, PMID:21664573, PomBase:mah, PomBase:vw]
comment: Checkpoint activation in a mutant usually implies that the mutation is causing problems that the checkpoint detects.
synonym: "decreased rate of deactivation of mitotic cell cycle spindle assembly checkpoint" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased rate of mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint deactivation" EXACT [GO:1902426]
synonym: "decreased rate of mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint silencing" EXACT [GO:1902426]
synonym: "delayed inactivation of the mitotic SAC" EXACT []
synonym: "delayed inactivation of the mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint" EXACT []
synonym: "delayed inactivation of the SAC" BROAD []
synonym: "reduced rate of deactivation of mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000168 ! abnormal mitotic spindle assembly checkpoint
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2016-11-02T13:49:32Z

