[Term]
id: FYPO:0005879
name: C-shaped interphase microtubules
def: "A physical cellular phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells form cytoplasmic microtubules that are curved to form a \"C\" shape, i.e. they follow a smooth bend rather than a straight line, with the curve centered at or near the midpoint of the microtubule, during interphase of the mitotic cell cycle." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "C-shaped cytoplasmic microtubules during mitotic interphase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "C-shaped interphase cytoplasmic microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "C-shaped interphase microtubules during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "C-shaped interphase microtubules during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "curved C-shaped interphase microtubules" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0003327 ! curved interphase microtubules
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-01-11T11:07:04Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005880
name: long interphase microtubules curved around cell end
def: "A physical cellular phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells form microtubules that are longer than normal and are curved, i.e. follow a smooth bend rather than a straight line, and extend around one or both ends of the cell, during interphase of the mitotic cell cycle." [PMID:14663827, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated interphase microtubules curved around cell end" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "long cytoplasmic microtubules curved around cell end during interphase of mitotic cell cycle" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "long cytoplasmic microtubules curved around cell end during mitotic interphase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "long interphase cytoplasmic microtubules curved around cell end" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "long interphase microtubules curved around cell end during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "long interphase microtubules curved around cell tip" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0004511 ! long curved interphase microtubules
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-01-11T11:11:21Z

[Term]
