synonym: "ectopic CENP-A containing nucleosome assembly during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "ectopic CENP-A deposition" RELATED [GO:0034080]
synonym: "ectopic CENP-A loading" RELATED [GO:0034080]
synonym: "ectopic centromere-specific histone exchange" EXACT [GO:0034080]
synonym: "ectopic centromere-specific nucleosome assembly" EXACT [GO:0034080]
synonym: "ectopic centromeric DNA replication-independent nucleosome assembly" EXACT [GO:0034080]
synonym: "multiple foci of CENP-A" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0003409 ! abnormal CENP-A containing chromatin assembly
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-01-11T14:07:46Z

[Term]
