name: normal growth on magnesium chloride
def: "A phenotype in which vegetative cell population growth is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) in a medium containing magnesium chloride." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cell population growth in presence of magnesium chloride" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cell population growth on magnesium chloride" EXACT [PomBase:al, PomBase:mah, PomBase:vw]
synonym: "normal cell population growth on MgCl2" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cellular response to magnesium chloride" RELATED [PomBase:al, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal growth on magnesium dichloride" EXACT [CHEBI:6636]
synonym: "normal vegetative cell population growth on magnesium chloride" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001357 ! normal vegetative cell population growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-03-31T11:54:48Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0005971
