[Term]
id: FYPO:0005972
name: decreased proton export during cellular response to glucose stimulus
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the occurrence of proton export is decreased during a cellular response to glucose stimulus." [PomBase:mah]
