[Term]
id: FYPO:0005974
name: normal mitochondrial protein level
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount of protein measured in the mitochondria is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). Total protein or a specific protein may be measured." [PomBase:mah]
