[Term]
id: FYPO:0006036
name: increased cytosolic monomeric ribosome level
def: "A physical cellular phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells contain more monomeric ribosomes (80S monosomes) in the cytosol than normal." [PMID:10462529, PomBase:mah]
