synonym: "decreased level of cytosolic half-mer polysomes" RELATED [PomBase:al]
synonym: "reduced cytosolic half-mer polysome level" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0003684 ! altered level of macromolecular complex during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-06-05T16:28:21Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006038
name: normal cytoplasmic translational initiation
def: "A metabolism phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the initiation of translation in the cytoplasm is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). Translational initiation is he process preceding formation of the peptide bond between the first two amino acids of a protein in the cytoplasm." [GO:0002183, PomBase:mah]
