synonym: "increased rate of kinetochore sliding during metaphase chromosome retrieval to the spindle pole body" EXACT [GO:1990942]
synonym: "increased rate of kinetochore sliding during mitotic metaphase chromosome recapture" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased rate of kinetochore sliding during sister kinetochore recapture" EXACT [GO:1990942]
synonym: "increased rate of kinetochore sliding towards SPB during chromosome recapture" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased rate of kinetochore sliding towards spindle pole body during chromosome recapture" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0005362 ! abnormal mitotic metaphase chromosome recapture
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-06-07T11:38:20Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006044
name: long mitotic kinetochore microtubules with kinetochore at tip of nuclear envelope protrusion
def: "A physical cellular phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells form mitotic spindle microtubules that are longer than normal, and the protruding kinetochore microtubules are surrounded by an extension of the nuclear envelope, with the kinetochore-attached end at the distal tip of the protrusion." [PMID:27146110, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated mitotic kinetochore microtubules with kinetochore at tip of nuclear envelope protrusion" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated mitotic kinetochore microtubules with kinetochore at tip of nuclear envelope protrusion during M-phase" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
