synonym: "long mitotic spindle microtubules with nuclear envelope protrusion from the kinetochore attached end of the microtubule" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "nuclear envelope protrusion with long mitotic kinetochore microtubules and kinetochore at tip of nuclear envelope protrusion" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
