creation_date: 2017-06-07T11:57:57Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006048
name: unstable mitotic spindle
def: "A cell phenotype in which a mitotic spindle assembles, but does not remain at a constant length or gradually elongate." [PMID:23885124, PMID:27146110, PomBase:mah]
