def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the assembly of actin filament bundles is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal actin bundling" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal actin filament bundle assembly during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal actin filament bundle assembly during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
