def: "A cellular process phenotype in which actin fusion focus assembly is abnormal. An actin fusion focus normally forms during mating at the site where the two cells will fuse." [PMID:28410370, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal actin fusion focus formation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
