is_a: FYPO:0005558 ! abnormal microtubule bundle
relationship: has_part FYPO:0005880 ! long interphase microtubules curved around cell end
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-08-16T11:20:43Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006196
