[Term]
id: FYPO:0006244
name: obsolete abolished short range intra-arm mitotic chromosome condensation during interphase
def: "OBSOLETE. A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which mitotic chromosome condensation does not occur over short (less than 90 kb) ranges within a chromosome arm." [PMID:28825727, PomBase:mah]
comment: This term was made obsolete because it was added in error and does not describe an observed phenotype.
is_obsolete: true
consider: FYPO:0006302
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-10-17T13:42:29Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006245
name: obsolete decreased medium range intra-arm mitotic chromosome condensation during interphase
def: "OBSOLETE. A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which mitotic chromosome condensation is decreased over medium (90-940 kb) ranges within a chromosome arm." [PMID:28825727, PomBase:mah]
comment: This term was made obsolete because it was added in error and does not describe an observed phenotype.
synonym: "decreased medium range intra-arm chromosome condensation during interphase of mitotic cell cycle" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased medium range intra-arm chromosome condensation during mitotic interphase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased medium range intra-arm mitotic chromosome condensation during interphase during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "reduced medium range intra-arm mitotic chromosome condensation during interphase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_obsolete: true
consider: FYPO:0006302
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-10-17T13:47:24Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006246
name: increased protein localization to nucleus during cellular response to osmotic stress
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the localization of a protein to the nucleus is increased during a cellular response to osmotic stress." [PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "increased protein localisation to nucleus during cellular response to osmotic stress during vegetative growth" EXACT [GO:0034504, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased protein localization to nucleus during cellular response to osmotic stress during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased protein localization to nucleus during osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001130 ! increased protein localization to nucleus during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-10-17T13:55:26Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006247
name: premature mitotic G2/M phase transition during cellular response to osmotic stress
def: "A cell cycle phenotype in which the G2/M transition of the mitotic cell cycle begins earlier than normal during a cellular response to osmotic stress. The duration of G2 phase is thus shorter than normal. The mitotic G2/M transition is the point at which a cell commits to entering M phase, and begins when the kinase activity of M cyclin/CDK complex reaches a threshold high enough for the cell cycle to proceed." [GO:0000086, PomBase:mah]
comment: Use this term if you have measured CDK activity or calculated the transition point to detect the transition; otherwise, consider using 'premature mitosis' (FYPO:0001046) or one of its descendants. A G2/M advance may indicate that a checkpoint, such as the DNA replication checkpoint or the G2/M DNA damage checkpoint, is impaired. Checkpoint activation can be tested using checkpoint kinase mutants.
synonym: "advanced mitotic G2 phase progression during cellular response to osmotic stress" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "advanced mitotic G2/M transition during cellular response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "cell cycle, mitotic G2 advance during cellular response to osmotic stress" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased duration of mitotic G2 phase during cellular response to osmotic stress" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased duration of mitotic G2 phase during cellular response to osmotic stress during vegetative growth" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased mitotic G2 duration during cellular response to osmotic stress" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased rate of mitotic G2 phase progression during cellular response to osmotic stress" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mitotic cell cycle advance at G2/M transition during cellular response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mitotic G2 advance during cellular response to osmotic stress" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mitotic G2/M transition advance during cellular response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mitotic G2/M transition advance during cellular response to osmotic stress during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "premature cell cycle progression through mitotic G2/M phase transition during cellular response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "premature G2/M phase transition during cellular response to osmotic stress during mitotic cell cycle" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "premature mitotic G2/M phase transition during cellular response to osmotic stress during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "premature mitotic G2/M transition during cellular response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0002516 ! premature mitotic G2/M phase transition
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-10-17T14:13:09Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006248
name: increased centromere clustering at nuclear periphery during mitosis
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the localization of centromeres and associated kinetochores into a cluster at the nuclear periphery is increased during mitosis. Normally, centromere-kinetochore complexes cluster near the old spindle pole body during interphase of the mitotic cell cycle, but are not as tightly clustered during mitosis." [PMID:28825727, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased centromere clustering at nuclear periphery during M phase of mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased centromere clustering at nuclear periphery during mitosis during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased centromere clustering at old mitotic spindle pole body during mitosis" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased centromere clustering at SPB during mitosis" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased centromere clustering at spindle pole body during mitosis" RELATED [GO:0072766, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased centromere-SPB clustering during mitosis" RELATED [GO:0072766]
synonym: "increased inter-centromere connection during mitosis" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased kinetochore clustering at old mitotic spindle pole body during mitosis" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased kinetochore clustering at SPB during mitosis" RELATED [GO:0072766]
synonym: "increased kinetochore clustering at spindle pole body during mitosis" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased kinetochore localization at spindle pole body during mitosis" RELATED [GO:0072766]
synonym: "increased kinetochores to spindle pole body clustering during mitosis" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased mitotic centromere clustering at nuclear periphery during mitosis" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0001779 ! abnormal centromere clustering at nuclear periphery during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-10-17T16:06:21Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006249
name: normal tRNA aminoacylation
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which tRNA aminoacylation, the formation of an ester bond between a tRNA molecule and an amino acid specified by the tRNA anticodon, is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [GO:0006418, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal tRNA aminoacylation during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal tRNA aminoacylation during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal tRNA aminoacylation for protein translation" EXACT [GO:0006418]
