[Term]
id: FYPO:0006253
name: normal tRNA binding
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which an interaction between a protein and transfer RNA (tRNA) is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). One of the relevant gene products may be encoded by the mutated gene, or both the RNA and protein may be encoded by genes other than the mutated one." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal protein-transfer RNA interaction" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal protein-tRNA interaction" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal transfer RNA binding" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
