synonym: "increased level of short ribosome footprints upon UPR induction" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0006254 ! abnormal ribosome footprint size distribution
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-10-23T14:14:08Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006256
name: normal mitotic cohesin unloading
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cohesin unloading is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). Cohesin unloading is the topological unlinking of a cohesin ring complex from chromatin, which negatively regulates sister chromatid cohesion." [GO:0061781, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cohesin unloading during mitotic cell cycle" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cohesin unloading during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
