synonym: "actomyosin contractile ring absent, with medial F-actin spot present" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "medial F-actin spot present during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "medial F-actin spot present during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001008 ! actomyosin contractile ring absent
is_a: FYPO:0002398 ! abnormal actin cytoskeleton during vegetative growth
relationship: has_part FYPO:0001008 ! actomyosin contractile ring absent
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-12-11T14:15:45Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006305
name: normal actin monomer binding
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which the binding of a protein to one or more actin monomers is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). The relevant actin-binding protein may be encoded by the mutated gene, or by a different gene." [PomBase:mah]
comment: This term can be used for any interaction with actin filaments that is assayed in a mutant, whether or not the mutated gene product is one of the interacting proteins. We recommend noting which proteins were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "normal G-actin binding" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000703 ! normal protein-protein interaction
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-12-12T14:41:34Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006306
name: abnormal actin filament-based process
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which an actin filament-based process, i.e. any process that depends upon or alters the actin cytoskeleton, is abnormal." [GO:0030029, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal actin filament-based process during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal actin filament-based process during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal microfilament-based process" RELATED [GO:0030029]
is_a: FYPO:0001362 ! abnormal cellular process during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-12-12T14:44:34Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006307
name: decreased actin filament severing
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which actin filament severing is decreased. Actin filament severing is the process in which an actin filament is broken down into smaller filaments." [GO:0051014, PMID:22024167, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased actin filament severing during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased actin filament severing during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased F-actin severing" EXACT [GO:0051014]
synonym: "reduced actin filament severing" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0006306 ! abnormal actin filament-based process
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-12-12T14:44:43Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006308
name: thick actin cables in medial region
def: "A physical cellular phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which cells form actin cables that are thicker than normal in the medial region of the cell." [PomBase:mah]
comment: Cells with this phenotype usually have thick actin cables instead of a well-formed contractile ring near the midpoint of the cell, when the ring would normally form and contract during cytokinesis.
synonym: "increased actin cable thickness in medial region" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "thick actin cables in medial region during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "thick actin cables in medial region during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "thick actin cables in medial region of cell" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "thick formin-nucleated actin cables in medial region" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0002437 ! thick actin cables
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2017-12-12T14:49:31Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006309
name: increased nucleosome occupancy at FLEX element
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which nucleosome occupancy is greater than normal at promoters containing FLEX elements. Nucleosome occupancy measures the tendency for DNA in a given region to be packaged into nucleosomes." [PMID:26804917, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased nucleosome occupancy at FLEX element during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased nucleosome occupancy at FLEX element during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
