[Term]
id: FYPO:0006314
name: abolished ascus formation
def: "A cell phenotype in which formation of the ascus, the sac-like structure that encloses spores, does not occur." [PMID:29259000, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished asci formation" EXACT [PMID:29259000, PomBase:vw]
