def: "A cell phenotype in which the localization of a protein to the meiotic spindle pole body is decreased during the second meiotic nuclear division." [PMID:29259000, PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term. Use this term for cells in which in which the re-accumulation of some spindle pole body components does not occur at the onset of meiosis I.
