id: FYPO:0006337
name: decreased interphase microtubule nucleation from spindle pole body
def: "A microtubule cytoskeleton organization phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which nucleation of cytoplasmic microtubules from the spindle pole body (SPB) occurs to a lesser extent than normal during interphase of the mitotic cell cycle. Normally, microtubules are nucleated from interphase microtubule organizing centers (iMTOCs) and from the cytoplasmic face of the SPB." [PMID:8834801, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased cytoplasmic microtubule nucleation from spindle pole body during mitotic interphase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased interphase microtubule nucleation by spindle pole body" EXACT [GO:0051417]
synonym: "decreased interphase microtubule nucleation from SPB" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased interphase microtubule nucleation from spindle pole body during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased microtubule nucleation from spindle pole body during interphase of mitotic cell cycle" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "reduced interphase microtubule nucleation from spindle pole body" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0005694 ! decreased interphase microtubule nucleation
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-01-23T15:01:06Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006338
name: nucleus mislocalized towards cell tip during mitotic telophase
def: "A physical cellular phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the divided nuclei are located near the cell tips (instead of at the midpoint of the long axis of each daughter cell) during telophase of the mitotic cell cycle." [PMID:15937127, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "nuclear displacement towards cell tip during mitotic telophase" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "nucleus displaced towards cell tip during mitotic telophase" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "nucleus mislocalised to cell tip during mitotic telophase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "nucleus mislocalized towards cell end during mitotic telophase" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "nucleus mislocalized towards cell tip during mitotic telophase during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "nucleus mislocalized towards cell tip during mitotic telophase during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "telophase nucleus mislocalized to cell tip" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0009105 ! mislocalized nucleus during mitotic telophase
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-01-23T15:05:46Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006339
name: mononucleate vegetative cell with mislocalized nucleus
def: "A cell phenotype in which a cell has one nucleus that is not in the normal location." [PMID:15937127, PomBase:mah, PomBase:vw]
comment: Note that if you have done an experiment that assays the viability of a population of cells, such as looking at colony growth or growth in liquid culture, you should also annotate to 'inviable cell population' (FYPO:0002059) or one of its descendants.
synonym: "lethal; mononucleate vegetative cell with mislocalized nucleus" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mononucleate cell with abnormal nucleus location" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mononucleate cell with abnormal nucleus position" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mononucleate cell with asymmetrically localized nucleus" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "mononucleate cell with displaced nucleus" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mononucleate cell with mislocalised nucleus" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mononucleate cell with mislocalized nucleus during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mononucleate cell with misplaced nucleus" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mononucleate vegetative cell with mislocalized nucleus during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "vegetative cell with mislocalized mononucleus" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
