synonym: "increased centromere central core-derived RNA transcript level" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased centromeric core transcript level" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0004982 ! increased centromeric transcript level
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-02-06T12:14:14Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006354
name: abnormal transcription during glucose starvation
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which transcription is abnormal when the cell is subject to glucose starvation. All genes, or a specific subset of genes, may be affected." [PomBase:mah]
comment: Note that FYPO uses "glucose starvation" to refer specifically to conditions in which glucose is scarce enough to trigger mating, meiosis, and sporulation. For phenotypes observed in the presence of enough glucose to prevent cells from mating, use a term that specifies "during vegetative growth" plus a condition to indicate low glucose.
synonym: "abnormal transcription during cellular response to glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal transcription during glucose depletion" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abnormal transcription during glucose deprivation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abnormal transcription during glucose limitation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal transcription in response to glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0005502 ! abnormal transcription
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-02-06T13:14:29Z

