[Term]
id: FYPO:0006472
name: decreased translation of amino acid biosynthesis proteins in response to amino acid starvation
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the occurrence of translation of one or more proteins involved in amino acid biosynthesis is decreased in response to starvation for one or more amino acids." [PMID:29432178, PomBase:mah]
