[Term]
id: FYPO:0006499
name: abnormal cell wall disassembly at cell fusion site
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which disassembly of the cell wall at the site of cell-cell fusion during mating is abnormal." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal cell wall disassembly at cell fusion site during conjugation with cellular fusion" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
