[Term]
id: FYPO:0006575
name: abnormal negative regulation of mitotic DNA replication initiation resulting in complete rereplication, with otherwise normal S phase
def: "A regulation phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which abnormal negative regulation of the initiation of mitotic DNA replication results in one or more rounds of rereplication of the entire genome, but takes place during S phases that appear nearly normal apart from occurring without intervening mitoses. Origin usage is normal, rounds of DNA synthesis are correlated with G1/S phase gene expression and cell mass increase, and the genome is replicated evenly." [PMID:19487461, PMID:20736315, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal negative regulation of DNA replication initiation resulting in complete rereplication, with otherwise normal S phase, during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal negative regulation of mitotic DNA replication initiation resulting in complete rereplication, with otherwise normal S phase, during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "cell cycling without mitosis" RELATED [PomBase:al, PomBase:jh]
is_a: FYPO:0001425 ! abnormal negative regulation of mitotic DNA replication initiation resulting in complete rereplication
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-06-13T13:41:06Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006576
name: abnormal negative regulation of mitotic DNA replication initiation resulting in complete rereplication, with abnormal S phase
def: "A regulation phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which abnormal negative regulation of the initiation of mitotic DNA replication results in one or more rounds of rereplication of the entire genome, and other features of S phase are abnormal. Rounds of replication are not correlated with G1/S phase gene expression, and origin usage is altered." [PMID:19487461, PMID:20736315, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal negative regulation of DNA replication initiation resulting in complete rereplication, with abnormal S phase, during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal negative regulation of mitotic DNA replication initiation resulting in complete rereplication, with abnormal S phase, during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal negative regulation of mitotic DNA replication initiation resulting in continuous DNA synthesis" RELATED [PomBase:al]
is_a: FYPO:0001425 ! abnormal negative regulation of mitotic DNA replication initiation resulting in complete rereplication
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-06-13T13:43:39Z

