created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-07-16T14:33:56Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006620
name: abnormal chromatin organization during recovery from glucose starvation
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which any process of chromatin organization is abnormal when the cell is returned to glucose-rich medium following glucose starvation." [GO:0006325, PomBase:mah]
comment: Note that FYPO uses "glucose starvation" to refer specifically to conditions in which glucose is scarce enough to trigger mating, meiosis, and sporulation. For phenotypes observed in the presence of enough glucose to prevent cells from mating, use a term that specifies "during vegetative growth" plus a condition to indicate low glucose.
synonym: "abnormal chromatin organisation during recovery from glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal chromatin organization during recovery from glucose depletion" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abnormal chromatin organization during recovery from glucose deprivation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abnormal chromatin organization during recovery from glucose limitation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal chromatin organization following glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000642 ! abnormal chromatin organization
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-07-16T14:45:28Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006621
name: normal H3-K4 deacetylation during recovery from glucose starvation
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which deacetylation of lysine at position 4 of histone H3 is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) when the cell is returned to glucose-rich medium following glucose starvation." [PomBase:mah]
comment: Note that FYPO uses "glucose starvation" to refer specifically to conditions in which glucose is scarce enough to trigger mating, meiosis, and sporulation. For phenotypes observed in the presence of enough glucose to prevent cells from mating, use a term that specifies "during vegetative growth" plus a condition to indicate low glucose.
synonym: "normal H3-K4 deacetylation during recovery from glucose depletion" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "normal H3-K4 deacetylation during recovery from glucose deprivation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "normal H3-K4 deacetylation during recovery from glucose limitation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal H3-K4 deacetylation following glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal H3K4 deacetylation during recovery from glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0002495 ! normal protein modification
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-07-16T14:48:17Z

[Term]
