id: FYPO:0006719
name: abolished mitochondrial fission during cellular response to osmotic stress
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which mitochondrial fission does not occur during a cellular response to osmotic stress. Normally, mitochondria undergo fission when the cell is exposed to hyperosmotic conditions." [PMID:28515144, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished mitochondrial fission during cellular response to osmotic stress during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished mitochondrial fission during cellular response to osmotic stress during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished mitochondrial fragmentation during cellular response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PMID:28515144]
synonym: "mitochondrial fission abolished during cellular response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0004340 ! abnormal mitochondrial fission
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-11-01T10:46:07Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006720
name: normal cell cycle regulation during cellular response to osmotic stress
def: "A cellular response phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the regulation of the mitotic cell cycle in response to osmotic stress is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). Normally, cell cycle progression is slowed or arrested transiently following exposure to osmotic stress." [PMID:28924043, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cell cycle delay following osmotic stress" NARROW [PomBase:al]
synonym: "normal cell cycle regulation during cellular response to osmotic stress during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cell cycle regulation during cellular response to osmotic stress during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cell cycle regulation in response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal mitotic cell cycle regulation during cellular response to osmotic stress" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001928 ! normal regulation of mitotic cell cycle
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-11-01T10:56:00Z

