synonym: "defective centromere detachment from the SPB during karyogamy and meiotic prophase" EXACT [PMID:27611693]
is_a: FYPO:0006759 ! abnormal meiotic chromosome organization
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2018-11-20T16:16:26Z

