[Term]
id: FYPO:0006850
name: abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition following single cell division during nitrogen starvation
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which progression through the mitotic cell cycle is arrested at the mitotic G2/M phase transition, instead of the normal G1 phase, and after the cell undergoes one cell division instead of the normal two, when the cell is subject to nitrogen starvation." [PMID:9472077, PomBase:mah]
comment: This term can be used for any circumstances in which cells are starved for nitrogen. Note that cells may enter G0 (quiescence) when subjected to prolonged nitrogen starvation; this term is not restricted to G0. This term differs from 'abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition during nitrogen starvation' (FYPO:0001001) because it additionally specifies a single cell division, and from 'single cell division prior to G0 entry' (FYPO:0003877) because it does not apply only to G0, and does specify arrest in G2.
synonym: "abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition following single cell division during nitrogen depletion" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition following single cell division during nitrogen deprivation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "abnormal cell cycle arrest in mitotic G2 phase following single cell division during nitrogen starvation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal mitotic cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition following single cell division during nitrogen starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished mitotic G2/M phase transition following single cell division during nitrogen starvation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition following single cell division during nitrogen starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "mitotic G2 phase arrest following single cell division during nitrogen starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "one cell division prior to cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition during nitrogen starvation" EXACT [PomBase:al]
is_a: FYPO:0001001 ! abnormal cell cycle arrest at mitotic G2/M phase transition during nitrogen starvation
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-04-03T14:29:21Z

