def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the localization of a protein to the actomyosin contractile ring is radially asymmetric." [PMID:30709916, PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "abnormal protein distribution within the actomyosin contractile ring" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "asymmetric protein localisation to actomyosin contractile ring" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "asymmetric protein localization to actomyosin contractile ring during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "asymmetric protein localization to actomyosin contractile ring during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "asymmetric protein recruitment to actomyosin contractile ring" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "inhomogeneous protein localisation to actomyosin contractile ring" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "inhomogeneous protein localization to actomyosin contractile ring" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "non-homogeneous protein localization to actomyosin contractile ring" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "uneven protein localization to actomyosin contractile ring" EXACT [PMID:30709916]
is_a: FYPO:0002560 ! abnormal protein localization to actomyosin contractile ring
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-02T16:20:40Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006941
name: increased duration of protein localization to actin cortical patch
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which one or more proteins is localized to actin cortical patches for a longer time than normal." [PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "increased duration of protein localisation to actin cortical patch" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased duration of protein localization to actin cortical patch during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased duration of protein localization to actin cortical patch during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased duration of protein localization to actin cortical patch involved in mitotic cytokinesis" EXACT [GO:1904498]
synonym: "increased duration of protein localization to actin patch" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased duration of protein localization to F-actin patch" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000742 ! abnormal protein localization to actin cortical patch
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-02T16:28:46Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006942
name: normal lipid binding
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which occurrence of lipid binding by a gene product (usually a protein) in a mutant is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000706 ! normal molecular function
is_a: FYPO:0001092 ! binding phenotype
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-03T15:01:57Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006943
name: normal 3'-5' RNA helicase activity
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which the observed rate of an 3'-5' RNA helicase activity is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000660 ! normal catalytic activity
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-05T11:22:33Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006944
name: decreased ribosomal protein level
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount on one or more ribosomal proteins measured in a cell is lower than normal." [PMID:30862564, PomBase:mah]
comment: Also consider annotating to 'decreased translation of ribosomal proteins during vegetative growth' (FYPO:0004010), 'increased degradation of ribosomal proteins during vegetative growth' (FYPO:0004011), or both; bear in mind that either can lower the observed level of ribosomal proteins in a cell. We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "decreased cellular ribosomal protein level" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased ribosomal protein level during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased ribosomal protein level during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "reduced ribosomal protein level" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001324 ! decreased protein level during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-08T13:24:14Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006945
name: increased lipid droplet formation
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which the occurrence of lipid droplet formation is increased." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased lipid droplet assembly" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased lipid particle formation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0008430 ! abnormal lipid droplet formation
relationship: has_output FYPO:0002552 ! lipid droplets present in decreased numbers
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-11T14:28:49Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006946
name: inviable swollen elongated multiseptate vegetative cell
def: "A cell morphology phenotype in which a vegetative cell is inviable, is swollen, is elongated, and contains more than one septum. In a swollen cell, both length and diameter may be greater than normal, although the cell is only considered elongated if the length:diameter ratio is also greater than normal." [PomBase:mah]
comment: The distinction between this phenotype and centrally constricted (dumbbell-shaped) cells (FYPO:0000779) is that swollen elongated cells do not have a constriction along the long axis. Swollen elongated cells may have a uniform diameter, or may be swollen only around the nucleus.
synonym: "inviable large elongated multiseptate vegetative cell" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "lethal; swollen elongated multiseptate vegetative cell" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0001494 ! inviable elongated multiseptate vegetative cell
is_a: FYPO:0002845 ! inviable swollen elongated septated vegetative cell
is_a: FYPO:0007436 ! swollen elongated multiseptate vegetative cell
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-11T14:43:14Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006947
name: protein mislocalized to cytoplasm during glucose starvation
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which a protein that is not normally found in the cytoplasm is observed there when the cell is subject to glucose starvation." [PomBase:mah]
comment: Note that this term can be used to annotate any case where a protein is found in the cytoplasm in a mutant, but not in wild type. In some cases, there may be enough additional information to annotate to 'abnormal protein localization' (FYPO:0000443) or one of its descendants. We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term. Note that FYPO uses "glucose starvation" to refer specifically to conditions in which glucose is scarce enough to trigger mating, meiosis, and sporulation. For phenotypes observed in the presence of enough glucose to prevent cells from mating, use a term that specifies "during vegetative growth" plus a condition to indicate low glucose.
synonym: "ectopic protein localization to cytoplasm during glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "protein mislocalised to cytoplasm during glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "protein mislocalized to cytoplasm during glucose depletion" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "protein mislocalized to cytoplasm during glucose deprivation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0004842 ! protein mislocalized to cytoplasm
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-11T14:45:41Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0006948
name: normal protein level during glucose starvation
def: "A cell phenotype in which the amount of protein measured in a cell that is subject to glucose starvation is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). Total protein or a specific protein may be affected." [PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term. Note that FYPO uses "glucose starvation" to refer specifically to conditions in which glucose is scarce enough to trigger mating, meiosis, and sporulation. For phenotypes observed in the presence of enough glucose to prevent cells from mating, use a term that specifies "during vegetative growth" plus a condition to indicate low glucose.
synonym: "normal cellular protein level during glucose starvation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal protein accumulation during glucose starvation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal protein level during glucose depletion" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "normal protein level during glucose deprivation" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0004083 ! normal protein level
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-11T14:50:00Z

