id: FYPO:0007002
name: normal histone exchange at silent mating-type cassette
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which histone exchange occurs to a normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) extent at the silent mating-type cassette. Histone exchange is replacement, within chromatin, of resident histones or histone subunits with alternative, sometimes variant, histones or subunits." [GO:0005721, GO:0043486, PMID:26518661, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal histone exchange at silent mating-type cassette during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal histone exchange at silent mating-type cassette during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal histone exchange at silent mating-type locus" EXACT [PomBase:al]
is_a: FYPO:0006999 ! normal dynamic protein localization pattern
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-07-30T15:55:57Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007003
name: normal histone exchange at tRNA genes
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which histone exchange occurs to a normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) extent at tRNA genes. Histone exchange is replacement, within chromatin, of resident histones or histone subunits with alternative, sometimes variant, histones or subunits." [GO:0005721, GO:0043486, PMID:26518661, PomBase:mah]
