def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which negative regulation of transcription as a consequence of the presence of one or more specific nutrient(s) is abnormal. For example, specific genes that are normally not transcribed in the presence of the nutrient may be transcribed in the mutant, or vice versa." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal regulation of transcription by nutrient during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal regulation of transcription by nutrient during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "nutrient-insensitive transcription" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0001342 ! cellular response phenotype during vegetative growth
is_a: FYPO:0004527 ! abnormal regulation of transcription during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-10-11T11:26:53Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007091
name: increased negative regulation of transcription by zinc
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which negative regulation of transcription by zinc occurs to a greater extent than normal. Specific genes that are normally not transcribed in the presence of zinc ions are not derepressed in the mutant under conditions that derepress transcription in wild type cells." [PMID:31515876, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased gene repression in response to zinc" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased negative regulation of transcription by zinc during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased negative regulation of transcription by zinc during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased negative regulation of transcription in response to zinc" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000624 ! abnormal negative regulation of transcription during vegetative growth
is_a: FYPO:0007090 ! abnormal regulation of transcription by nutrient
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-10-11T11:27:14Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007092
name: increased DNA binding during cellular response to zinc ion
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which occurrence of DNA binding by a gene product is increased during a cellular response to zinc ions, when a gene or the bound DNA sequence is mutated. The affected gene product may be encoded by the mutated gene, or by a different gene." [PMID:31515876, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased DNA binding during cellular response to zinc" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000657 ! increased DNA binding
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-10-11T11:33:00Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007093
name: increased level of ribosomal protein gene mRNA during vegetative growth
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount of one or more RNAs transcribed from genes encoding ribosomal proteins measured in a cell is higher than normal (i.e. higher than observed in wild-type cells)." [PMID:28388826, PomBase:mah]
comment: Consider annotating to a term describing abnormal transcription or abnormal regulation of transcription, but note that changes in RNA levels may result from changes in RNA stability as well as changes in transcription.
synonym: "increased level of ribosomal protein gene mRNA during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased level of ribosomal protein gene RNA during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased level of ribosomal protein gene transcripts during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "increased ribosomal protein gene mRNA accumulation during vegetative growth" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000825 ! increased RNA level during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-10-11T11:42:15Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007094
name: increased duration of cell fusion during mating
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which cells fuse for a longer time than normal during mating." [PMID:31495586, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased duration of cell fusion during conjugation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased duration of plasma membrane fusion involved in cytogamy" EXACT [GO:0032220, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "prolonged cell fusion during mating" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
