is_a: FYPO:0001351 ! abnormal membrane organization during vegetative growth
created_by: midori
creation_date: 2019-10-11T11:59:08Z

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007095
name: increased protein localization to actin fusion focus
def: "A cell phenotype in which the localization of a protein to the actin fusion focus is increased." [PMID:31495586, PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "increased protein localisation to actin fusion focus" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
