[Term]
id: FYPO:0007096
name: decreased protein localization to actin fusion focus
def: "A cell phenotype in which the localization of a protein to the actin fusion focus is decreased." [PMID:31495586, PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
