[Term]
id: FYPO:0007325
name: increased tRNA binding
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which an interaction between a protein and a transfer RNA (tRNA) is increased. One of the relevant gene products may be encoded by the mutated gene, or both the RNA and protein may be encoded by genes other than the mutated one." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased protein-transfer RNA interaction" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased protein-tRNA interaction" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased transfer RNA binding" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
