def: "A cell phenotype which the total amount of DNA in a cell is lower than normal when the cell is in G0 phase." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased DNA content during cell quiescence" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased DNA level during G0" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
