synonym: "abolished chromatin silencing at pericentric region" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished chromatin silencing at pericentromeric region" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished heterochromatin silencing at centromere outer repeat region" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "chromatin silencing at centromere outer repeat abolished" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
