synonym: "delayed monopolar mitotic spindle nucleation from old spindle pole body" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "delayed onset of mitotic spindle microtubule nucleation from old SPB" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed onset of mitotic spindle microtubule nucleation from old spindle pole body during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed onset of mitotic spindle microtubule nucleation from old spindle pole body during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
