property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2020-07-01T14:27:16Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007429
name: abolished protein degradation during cellular response to DNA damage
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which protein degradation does not occur during a cellular response to DNA damage." [PMID:15805471, PomBase:mah]
