[Term]
id: FYPO:0007433
name: normal cellular dATP level
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount of dATP measured in a cell is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cellular dATP level during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal cellular dATP level during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
