[Term]
id: FYPO:0007453
name: decreased protein level in Arp2/3 complex
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the amount of a protein measured in the Arp2/3 protein complex is lower than normal." [PMID:10588653, PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
