[Term]
id: FYPO:0007454
name: decreased ATP binding
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which occurrence of ATP binding by a gene product (usually a protein) in a mutant is decreased. The affected gene product may be encoded by the mutated gene, or by a different gene." [PomBase:mah]
