[Term]
id: FYPO:0007456
name: increased 3' overhang single-stranded DNA endodeoxyribonuclease activity
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which the observed rate of 3' overhang single-stranded DNA endodeoxyribonuclease activity is increased." [PomBase:mah]
