[Term]
id: FYPO:0007472
name: abnormal histone exchange
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which histone exchange is abnormal. Histone exchange is replacement, within chromatin, of resident histones or histone subunits with alternative, sometimes variant, histones or subunits." [GO:0043486, PMID:31315658, PomBase:mah]
