def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the localization of a protein to the mitotic spindle pole body begins later than normal." [PMID:23333317, PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
