[Term]
id: FYPO:0007476
name: decreased duration of cell cycle arrest in mitotic G1 phase
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which the duration of an otherwise normal occurrence of cell cycle arrest in mitotic G1 phase is shorter than normal." [PMID:32361273, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased duration of cell cycle arrest in G1 phase during mitotic cell cycle" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased duration of cell cycle arrest in mitotic G1 phase during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
