[Term]
id: FYPO:0007477
name: abnormal epigenetic heterochromatin inheritance
def: "A phenotype in which the stable inheritance of heterochromatic structure is abnormal in regions of the genome where heterochromatin is normally maintained over successive generations." [PMID:29899117, PMID:31278118, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal epigenetic heterochromatin propagation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal epigenetic inheritance of heterochromatin" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
