synonym: "decreased histone H3K9 dimethylation at heterochromatin island at meiotic gene during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased histone H3K9me2 at heterochromatin island at meiotic gene during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "reduced histone H3-K9 dimethylation at heterochromatin island at meiotic gene during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
