id: FYPO:0007540
name: normal phosphorylation of RNA polymerase II C-terminal domain tyrosine 1 residues during vegetative growth
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the phosphorylation of the tyrosine residue at position 1 within one or more copies of the heptapeptide repeat (YSPTSPS) of the C-terminal domain of RNA polymerase II normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PMID:30282034, PomBase:mah]
