synonym: "abnormal nuclear envelope organization at mitotic nuclear bridge midzone" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000815 ! abnormal nuclear envelope organization
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2020-12-09T15:18:17Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007549
name: coalescence of partially separated nuclei
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the two DNA masses separated by mitotic anaphase remain linked by the nuclear bridge, and then merge back into a single nucleus." [PMID:32502403, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "coalescence of partially separated nuclei during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "coalescence of partially separated nuclei during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
