[Term]
id: FYPO:0007564
name: normal DNA binding at MCB
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which occurrence of DNA binding at a Mlu1 cell cycle box (MCB) by a gene product is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type). The relevant gene product may be encoded by the mutated gene, or by a different gene." [PMID:8223442, PomBase:mah]
