synonym: "variable cell size at division with subsequent division at abnormal size during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "variable cell size at division with subsequent division at abnormal size during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "variable vegetative cell size at division with subsequent division at abnormal size" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007474 ! variable cell size at division
