[Term]
id: FYPO:0007665
name: viable mononucleate monoseptate vegetative cell with anucleate compartment
def: "A physical cellular phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which a cell is viable, and contains one nucleus and one septum. The septum divides the cell into two compartments, one of which contains the nucleus." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "displaced nucleus with septum" RELATED [PMID:7798319]
synonym: "viable mononucleate monoseptate cell during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "viable mononucleate monoseptate vegetative cell" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "viable mononucleate monoseptate vegetative cell during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "viable with septation in the absence of nuclear division" RELATED [PomBase:al, PomBase:vw]
synonym: "viable with septation independent of mitosis" RELATED [PomBase:al, PomBase:vw]
synonym: "viable with septation without nuclear division" RELATED [PomBase:al, PomBase:vw]
is_a: FYPO:0001491 ! viable vegetative cell
is_a: FYPO:0007664 ! mononucleate monoseptate vegetative cell with anucleate compartment
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-03-02T14:54:38Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007666
name: normal establishment or maintenance of actin cytoskeleton polarity during mating
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which the establishment or maintenance of actin cytoskeleton polarity is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) during conjugation with cellular fusion." [PMID:9606213, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal actin cytoskeleton polarisation during conjugation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal actin cytoskeleton polarisation during mating" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal actin cytoskeleton polarization during conjugation" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal actin cytoskeleton polarization during mating" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "normal actin polarisation during mating" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "normal actin polarisation in shmoo during mating" NARROW [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "normal actin polarization during mating" RELATED [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "normal actin polarization in shmoo during mating" NARROW [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "normal establishment or maintenance of actin cytoskeleton polarity during conjugation" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000296 ! actin cytoskeleton organization phenotype
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-03-09T12:03:29Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007667
name: increased protein localization to shmoo tip
def: "A cell phenotype in which the localization of a protein to the tip of a shmoo, or mating projection, is decreased." [PMID:9606213, PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "increased protein localisation to shmoo tip" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased protein localization to mating projection tip" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0004802 ! abnormal protein localization to shmoo tip
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-03-09T12:09:51Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007668
name: elongated vegetative cell with cell cycle arrest in mitotic G1 phase
def: "A cell phenotype in which a vegetative cell is elongated and progression through the mitotic cell cycle is arrested in G1 phase." [PMID:8121488, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormal cell cycle arrest in mitotic G1 phase with elongated cell" EXACT [PomBase:vw]
synonym: "elongated cell with cell cycle arrest in mitotic G1 phase during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated vegetative cell with cell cycle arrest in G1 phase of mitotic cell cycle" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "elongated vegetative cell with mitotic G1 phase cell cycle arrest" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000445 ! cell cycle arrest in mitotic G1 phase
is_a: FYPO:0001122 ! elongated vegetative cell
