[Term]
id: FYPO:0007674
name: increased invertase activity
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which the observed rate of invertase activity (beta-fructofuranosidase activity) is increased." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased beta-fructofuranosidase activity" EXACT [GO:0004564]
is_a: FYPO:0005741 ! abnormal invertase activity
