id: FYPO:0007771
name: abnormally clustered protein localization to nuclear envelope
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which a protein is abnormally localized to one or more large clusters in the nuclear envelope. The protein may normally be distributed evenly in the nuclear envelope." [PMID:32109380, PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
synonym: "abnormal protein localization to nuclear envelope, with protein in large clusters" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormally clustered protein localisation to nuclear envelope" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormally clustered protein localization to nuclear envelope during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormally clustered protein localization to nuclear envelope during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormally clustered protein localization to nuclear membrane" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0004885 ! abnormal protein localization to nuclear envelope during vegetative growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T13:25:16Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007772
name: delayed onset of mitotic nuclear membrane reassembly
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which reformation of the nuclear envelope after mitotic nuclear division begins later than normal." [PMID:32109380, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed mitotic nuclear membrane reassembly" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed onset of mitotic nuclear envelope reassembly" RELATED [GO:0007084]
synonym: "delayed onset of mitotic nuclear membrane reassembly during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed onset of mitotic nuclear membrane reassembly during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000815 ! abnormal nuclear envelope organization
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T13:28:22Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007773
name: abnormal hyphal growth
def: "A phenotype in which any aspect of hyphal growth is abnormal." [GO:0030448, PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000002 ! cell phenotype
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T13:50:17Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007774
name: increased invasive hyphal growth
def: "A phenotype in which fission yeast forms hyphae that invade the growth medium to a greater extent than normal. Invasively growing cells are wash-resistant when cultured in agar solid medium for several days." [PMID:31150379, PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T14:02:27Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007775
name: increased hyphal length
def: "A phenotype in which hyphae are longer than normal." [PMID:31150379, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "long hyphae" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T14:03:58Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007776
name: decreased hyphal length
def: "A phenotype in which hyphae are shorter than normal." [PMID:31150379, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "short hyphae" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T14:04:50Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007777
name: increased hyphal branching
def: "A phenotype in which hyphae form more branched filaments than normal." [PMID:31150379, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased number of branched filaments" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T14:06:50Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007778
name: decreased hyphal branching
def: "A phenotype in which hyphae form fewer branched filaments than normal." [PMID:31150379, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased number of branched filaments" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T14:07:30Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007779
name: increased mycelial expansion
def: "A phenotype in which the mycelium formed by fission yeast undergoing hyphal growth covers a larger area than normal." [PMID:31150379, PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T14:25:05Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007780
name: decreased mycelial expansion
def: "A phenotype in which the mycelium formed by fission yeast undergoing hyphal growth covers a smaller area than normal." [PMID:31150379, PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T14:25:44Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007781
name: delayed onset of hyphal transition
def: "A phenotype in which the transition from yeast-form to hyphal growth begins later than normal." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed hyphal transition" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "delayed onset of transition to hyphal growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "midori" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-03T14:26:41Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007782
name: abolished hyphal transition
def: "A phenotype in which the transition from yeast-form to hyphal growth does not occur under conditions that normally induce it." [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished transition to hyphal growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "hyphal transition abolished" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0007773 ! abnormal hyphal growth
