property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-06-07T12:25:45Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007788
name: increased macroautophagy during vegetative growth
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the occurrence of macroautophagy is increased." [PMID:17121544, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "increased macroautophagy during mitotic cell cycle" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
is_a: FYPO:0000384 ! increased macroautophagy
