[Term]
id: FYPO:0007791
name: RNA absent from cell during cellular response to magnesium starvation
def: "A cell phenotype in which the amount of RNA measured in a cell when the cell is subject to magnesium starvation is lower than normal. Total RNA or a specific RNA may be affected." [PMID:33970532, PomBase:mah]
