[Term]
id: FYPO:0007793
name: delayed onset of increase in RNA level during cellular response to oxidative stress
def: "A cell phenotype in which an increase in RNA level that occurs as part of a cellular response to oxidative stress begins later than normal. Total RNA or a specific RNA, such as the mRNA transcribed from a gene of interest, may be affected." [PMID:10428959, PomBase:mah]
