[Term]
id: FYPO:0007799
name: protein mislocalized to cell surface during vegetative growth
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which a protein that is not normally found at the cell surface is observed there." [PomBase:mah]
comment: We recommend noting which protein(s) were used in the assay when annotating to this term.
