property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2021-10-05T14:52:31Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0007876
name: decreased plasma membrane waviness at shmoo tip
def: "A cell phenotype in which the plasma membrane is smoother than normal at the shmoo tip. Normally, the plasma membrane of one of a pair of mating cells is slack shmoo tip, forming waves instead of a smooth arc." [PMID:34382996, PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abnormally smooth plasma membrane at shmoo tip" RELATED [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased plasma membrane waviness at mating projection tip" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "decreased plasma membrane waviness at shmoo projection" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "reduced plasma membrane waviness at shmoo tip" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
