synonym: "abolished protein degradation during cellular response to methyl methanesulfonate during vegetative growth" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "abolished protein degradation during cellular response to MMS" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
synonym: "protein degradation during cellular response to methyl methanesulfonate abolished" EXACT [PomBase:mah]
