[Term]
id: FYPO:0008075
name: increased protein localization to cell cortex of cell tip during vegetative growth
def: "A cell phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which the localization of a protein to the cell cortex of one or both cell tips is increased." [PMID:25959226]
is_a: FYPO:0006875 ! abnormal protein localization to cell cortex of cell tip during vegetative growth
