[Term]
id: FYPO:0008078
name: normal meiotic sister kinetochore association in meiotic metaphase I
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which meiotic sister kinetochore association in meiotic metaphase I, is normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PMID:34851403]
