[Term]
id: FYPO:0008079
name: normal inositol heptakisphosphate 5-kinase activity
def: "A molecular function phenotype in which the observed rate and other catalytic properties of a inositol heptakisphosphate 5-kinase are normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type)." [PMID:36468882]
is_a: FYPO:0000660 ! normal catalytic activity
