[Term]
id: FYPO:0008090
name: normal onset of mitotic anaphase B
def: "A cellular process phenotype in which mitotic anaphase begins at the normal (i.e. indistinguishable from wild type) time relative to other cell cycle events." []
is_a: FYPO:0000627 ! normal cellular process
