[Term]
id: FYPO:0008092
name: growth auxotrophic for para-hydroxy benzoic acid
def: "Auxotrophy in which a cell is unable to synthesize para-hydroxy benzoic acid and therefore requires para-hydroxy benzoic acid in the medium for vegetative cell growth." [PMID:37156397]
