def: "A vegetative cell population phenotype in which a lower than normal proportion of cells is viable when the medium contains glycerol as carbon source. In High Throughput Phenotyping this is typically assessed using phloxine as a dye." [PMID:34984977]
synonym: "decreased viability on glycerol carbon source" BROAD []
