id: FYPO:0009052
name: increased cell population growth on glutamate nitrogen source
def: "A vegetative cell population phenotype in which cell growth is increased relative to normal in a medium containing glutamate as the nitrogen source." [PomBase:mlr]
comment: Note that cell growth terms refer to growth under aerobic conditions unless stated otherwise.
