comment: Note that cell growth terms refer to growth under aerobic conditions unless stated otherwise.
synonym: "decreased growth on glutamate nitrogen source" BROAD [PomBase:mlr]
synonym: "decreased vegetative cell growth on glutamate nitrogen source" EXACT [PomBase:mlr]
