[Term]
id: FYPO:0009056
name: decreased kinetochore microtubule depolymerization during mitotic anaphase A
def: "A cellular process phenotype observed in the vegetative growth phase of the life cycle in which kinetochore microtubule depolymerization, i.e. the removal of tubulin dimers from a kinetochore microtubule, occurs to a lesser extent than normal during anaphase A. Kinetochore microtubule depolymerisation drives chromosome movement during Anaphase A in S. pombe." [PMID:36435910]
is_a: FYPO:0005423 ! decreased mitotic spindle microtubule depolymerization during mitotic anaphase A
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "PomBase:mlr" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2023-04-20T15:23:30Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0009057
name: decreased rate of microtubule catastrophe involved in meitotic centromere clustering during meiotic prophase I
def: "A cellular process in which catastrophe rate (i.e. the frequency of transition from pause or growth to shrinkage) of microtubules is lower than normal as part of centromere clustering during meiotic prophase I." [PMID:36435910]
is_a: FYPO:0009058 ! decreased microtubule depolymerisation involved in meitotic centromere clustering during meiotic prophase I
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "PomBase:mlr" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2023-04-20T15:30:44Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FYPO:0009058
name: decreased microtubule depolymerisation involved in meitotic centromere clustering during meiotic prophase I
def: "A cellular process in which depolymerization (i.e. removal of tubulin dimers) of microtubules as part of centromere clustering during meiotic prophase I is decreased with respect to normal. This can happen due to lower catastrophe rate or depolymerisation speed." [PMID:23770679, PMID:36435910]
is_a: FYPO:0007113 ! abnormal microtubule cytoskeleton organization during meiotic cell cycle
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator "PomBase:mlr" xsd:string
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date "2023-04-20T15:31:31Z" xsd:dateTime

